3. Damage ordering is mandatory

When an attack connects, process its damage before calculating launch.

For a normal unblocked hit:

launchPointBefore = target.launchPoint
damage = hit.damage
target.launchPoint += damage
launchPointAfter = target.launchPoint
launchStrength = baseLaunch × launchPointAfter

The current hit therefore contributes to its own launch.

Example:

Launch Point before BA1 = 115
BA1 damage = 5
Launch Point after BA1 = 120
BA1 Base Launch = 1
final launch strength = 1 × 120 = 120

Do not calculate against 115.

